# Sarvam AI key for the site assistant.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the real key. .env.local is
# gitignored; never commit a key.
#
# Note that anything prefixed VITE_ is compiled into the browser bundle, so
# this key is readable by anyone who opens DevTools on the live site. That is
# accepted because the site has no backend to proxy through. Set a hard spend
# limit on the Sarvam dashboard, and rotate the key if usage looks wrong.
#
# Leave it empty and the assistant hides itself rather than erroring.
VITE_SARVAM_KEY=
